Para 9: LESSOR'S COVENANTS (per S.108(A) TPA):
   (a) Quiet enjoyment so long as lessee pays rent and performs covenants;
   (b) Disclosure of material defects;
   (c) Put lessee in possession on commencement;
   (d) Repair major / structural defects;
   (e) Pay property tax / land revenue;
   (f) Title warranty.

Para 10: LESSEE'S COVENANTS (per S.108(B) TPA):
   (a) Pay rent timely;
   (b) Disclose facts increasing rent value (if any);
   (c) Use property only for permitted purpose;
   (d) Not commit waste;
   (e) Permit lessor to inspect;
   (f) Repair ordinary wear and tear / minor damages;
   (g) Not erect permanent structure without consent;
   (h) Vacate and deliver possession at end of term;
   (i) Pay utilities, society charges, GST on rent (if applicable).
